==English==

===Etymology===
{{bor|en|ar|-}} surname of unxeplained origin; this surname is mainly found in [[Syria]] and [[Lebanon]].

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|s}}

# {{surname|en|from=Arabic}}.

====Statistics====
* According to the 2010 United States Census, ''Barbar'' is the 41426<sup>th</sup> most common surname in the United States, belonging to 525 individuals. ''Barbar'' is most common among White (62.29%) and Black/African American (25.33%) individuals.

